### 1. Login as the artist requesting transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "artist1@example.fr",
  "password": "Password@1234!",
  "userRole": "artiste"
}
> {%
  client.global.set("artist_token", response.body.token.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Artist initiates a transfer request to the destination gallery
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artists/request-transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{artist_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newGalleryId": "81af2c8c-cf2a-4bd2-91f2-3a40651b07c1",
  "reason": "Seeking broader international representation."
}